            "2. <b>Female Reproductive Organs:</b>",
            "&bull; <i>Ovary:</i> Paired primary female gonads that produce ova (eggs) and secrete female sex hormones (estrogen and progesterone).",
            "&bull; <i>Fallopian tube (Oviduct):</i> The site of fertilization where the ovum meets sperm.",
            "&bull; <i>Uterus (Womb):</i> The pear-shaped hollow muscular organ where the embryo implants and develops throughout pregnancy."
